{"id":"officiellement","lemma":"officiellement","pos":"adv","rank":2051,"glosses":["officially"],"ipa":"/ɔ.fi.sjɛl.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9b/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-officiellement.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-officiellement.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"On ne sort pas ensemble officiellement.","en":"We're not officially dating.","words":[{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"fate, destiny"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"together"},null]},{"text":"Je suis officiellement en vacances.","en":"I'm officially on vacation.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},null,{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"vacancy","l":"vacance"}]},{"text":"Je fais maintenant officiellement partie de ce groupe.","en":"I'm now officially part of this group.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"now, currently"},null,{"g":"part"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"group"}]},{"text":"Officiellement, nous n'autorisons pas cela.","en":"Officially, we don't allow that.","words":[null,{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to authorise","l":"autoriser"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"that"}]},{"text":"Officiellement, il travaille pour nous en tant qu'interprète.","en":"Officially, he works for us as an interpreter.","words":[null,{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to work","l":"travailler"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"so much"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"interpreter"}]}]}